    {
      "type": "h1",
      "text": "About us"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Bringing your vision to life"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Legendary Scapes is a full service professional landscape contractor. Services include landscape design/installation, plant recommendations, hard scapes, irrigation, lighting, drainage, sod, grade work, full service bed maintenance and care. We also build custom fences."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We can make any dream you have for your home a reality. Our commitment to your satisfaction is our number one priority and we guarantee our work. Our company is fully licensed and insured and our employees are highly experienced. References are available on request."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We look forward to the opportunity to earn your business."
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Our Team"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Blake Romero"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Blake founded Legendary Scapes in 2022 after a career in project management, operations and sales and is now following his passion to create amazing residential and commercial spaces."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Bobby Vannoy"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Robert studied civil engineering at University of Louisiana at Lafayette prior to joining as co-owner and head of engineering with Legendary Scapes."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Richard Buswell"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Richard has a BS degree from USL and a MS in psychology from CCU. Richard has his Landscape Maintenance Certification from the US Department of Labor, his Landscape Gardner Certification from the US Department of Labor, his Horticultural Grower Certificate from LTCC, his Building Construction Specialist Certificate from LTCC, and is certified in all heavy construction equipment with nearly a decade of experience in dirt work and excavation. He is licensed by the Louisiana Agricultural Department in Horticulture."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Julie Buswell"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Julie Buswell joined Legendary Scapes and quickly found her home running our fast growing maintenance division. Julie is highly creative and brings so many fantastic ideas to her division and builds lasting relationships with many of the customers she meets."
    },
    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "Our Partners"
    },
    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Follow us"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Copyright © 2023 Legendary Scapes - All Rights Reserved."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Powered by"
    },
