      "text": "This website uses cookies."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "We use cookies to analyze website traffic and optimize your website experience. By accepting our use of cookies, your data will be anonymous and aggregated with all other user data. Legendary Scapes never provides data to 3rd parties."
    }
